1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:03,110
♪ Don't go
breaking my heart ♪

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:05,980
Anybody do "Walking
on Sunshine" yet?

3
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:09,320
(Sheldon:)No.

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,020
(Stuart:)Dibs.

5
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:16,220
(Priya:)I'm sorry, Sheldon
bought a loom

6
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:18,420
(Priya:)and learned
how to weave?

7
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:19,860
(Leonard:)He actually
got pretty good.

8
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:22,360
(Leonard:)He made us
all matching serapes.

9
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:25,500
(Raj:)I still wear mine
when there's a nip in the air.

10
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,530
(Priya:)Now, was this before

11
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:29,640
(Priya:)or after he adopted
the 25 cats?

12
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,540
(Leonard:)Long before the cats.

13
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:33,040
(Leonard:)I think it was
around the time he tried

14
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:36,180
(Leonard:)to declare our apartment
a sovereign nation.

15
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:38,540
(Leonard:)I still have some
of the currency.

16
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:39,710
(knocking at door)

17
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,280
SHELDON:
All my friends.

18
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:46,090
(Sheldon(outside):)All my friends.

19
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:48,690
(Howard:)I think it's like Beetlejuice.

20
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:51,320
(Howard:)We said his name too many times.

21
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:55,490
(Penny:)Come on in.
Thank you.

22
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,900
(Leonard:)Hey. I thought you were
with your new buddies.

23
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,300
(Sheldon:)I had to leave.

